- asking Claude Code to write durable state files after each phase.

## 10. Self-Review Before Final Answer
Before presenting the final response, internally review your plan for:
- unsupported assumptions;
- ambiguity;
- overclaiming NSNO benefits;
- missing comparison to UVCGAN_V2;
- missing data-schema details;
- invalid physics-loss recommendations;
